chef.25=A cook should spend time at the stove, not hunting for a spoon. Take this utensil roll for an Apprentice. Equip it through their profile to help them cook more quickly.
chef.75=Good kitchens need more than one set of hands. I have shared my utensil roll plans with the town. A skilled crafter can make more at a tier two workbench.
merchant.25=A steady hand deserves proper tools. This case will help an Apprentice make jewelry more quickly. It cannot improve the quality of a gem, though. That still takes skill.
rancher.25=Keep the brush and shears close. Give this bag to an Apprentice through their profile and they can tend the ranch more quickly. The animals still need the same care each day.
blacksmith.75=You have earned my finest plans. A skilled Apprentice can forge this tool chest at a tier two anvil. Equip it through their profile for quicker smithing. Good tools never replace practice.
